        <!-- /health is not load tested: each call opens a Kafka connection, and it is meant for probes. Add a "read: ..." sampler here for each API endpoint the service gains (the batch record endpoints and the SCRUM-139 batch search are above; the SCRUM-135 dashboard is next). Only samplers labelled read: or write: are measured. -->
